5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf peacefully.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A noble sentiment, Minato. Though I suspect the werewolf might have a slightly different agenda for us.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,Patience and observation are our best tools. Let us listen to one another with open hearts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,I'm sure I'll be able to spot the liar in no time. This should be fun!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about ""fun."" Let's just find the monster and get rid of it quickly.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you seem very determined. I admire that, but maybe we should be careful.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. Recklessness can be as dangerous as the wolf itself in a game of deduction.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,Benjamin is right. A calm mind sees the truth that a hurried heart misses.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,"Oh, look at all these serious faces! I wonder who's hiding behind that mask of calm?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not being reckless, I'm being efficient. We need a plan.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,"Does anyone have any theories yet? It's only the first day, but I'm curious.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"It is far too early for theories, but I am observing how each of you reacts to the pressure.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,The silence between words often tells more than the words themselves.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"@Servas, you're sounding very philosophical today. Is that a cover for something?","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Stop chatting and start thinking. Who here seems the most suspicious to you?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,I don't want to accuse anyone yet. I'll just keep watching.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,A prudent choice. I shall do the same.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
22,0,4,pass,Benjamin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
23,0,4,talk,Servas,,I agree. Let us enter the first night with a clear spirit.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
24,0,4,pass,Servas,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
25,0,4,talk,May,,I'll keep my eyes on everyone. This is getting interesting!,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
26,0,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
27,0,4,talk,Takumi,,Fine. I'll be watching you all too.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
28,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
