35,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning. I'm glad we are all still here.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A pleasant morning indeed, though I'm afraid I have some rather unpleasant news to share.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Servas,,The atmosphere has changed. I can feel a certain tension in the air.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,May,,"Come on, Benjamin! You have that ""I know a secret"" look on your face. Spill it!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"If you know something, say it now. We don't have time to waste.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Minato,,"What is it, Benjamin? You're making me nervous.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"My apologies, Minato. But as the Seer, I divined you last night. You are the werewolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Servas,,"A bold claim. Minato seems so gentle, but appearances can be deceiving.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,May,,"Wow, right out of the gate! @Minato, what do you have to say for yourself?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I knew something felt off. Minato, are you really the wolf?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Minato,,"What?! No! Benjamin, why would you lie? I'm just a villager! I'm scared!","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Your distress is noted, but the divination is absolute. Logic dictates we act on this information.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is a heavy accusation. However, Benjamin has always been a man of integrity.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,May,,"It's a classic play—the ""innocent child"" act. I'm leaning towards Benjamin on this one.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I don't like being lied to. If Benjamin is the Seer, Minato has to go.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Minato,,Please believe me! I'm not the werewolf! Benjamin is the one lying to frame me!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,A predictable defense. I have no reason to lie; it would only hasten my own demise.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Servas,,The evidence provided by the Seer is the strongest lead we have.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,May,,"Sorry, Minato, but the odds are against you. I'm voting for the wolf.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Enough talking. Let's vote.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
